# CareerLinkAI frontend environment.
#
# **Normally empty.** The app and its API are one Cloudflare Worker deployment, so the frontend
# calls the relative path `/api/v1` (see src/services/httpClient.ts) and is same-origin with the
# backend in every environment — local, staging and production alike. There is nothing to
# configure here, and no per-environment build: one `dist/` is correct everywhere.
#
# `npm run dev` still runs Vite on :5173 while the Worker runs on :8787; vite.config.ts proxies
# /api from the first to the second, so the dev server is same-origin too.
#
# The one case that needs an override is pointing a local Vite at an already-deployed API —
# debugging staging data against local UI changes. Uncomment, and set that backend environment's
# FRONTEND_URL to http://localhost:5173 so §41's CORS allow-list admits the cross-origin call:
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://careerlinkai-staging.cejascarldindo.workers.dev/api/v1
